  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk/Tax Collector | Durham, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\n     Our Community   \t\t\t \n     Doing Business   \t\t\t \n     Inside Town Hall   \t\t\t \n     Helpful Resources   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t All Town Online Transactions \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Property Tax & Utility Bills \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t\t Durham's Top Dog \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Notary Public \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Voting and Election Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Upcoming Elections \r\n\t\t\t\t Polling Hours & Voting Location \r\n\t\t\t\t How to Register to Vote in Durham \r\n\t\t\t\t Student Voting \r\n\t\t\t Town of Durham Code \r\nHome \nInside Town Hall \nDepartments \nTown Clerk/Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk/Tax Collector\t\t \r\nPopular Online Links \nTOWN CLERK-TAX COLLECTOR'S OFFICE HOURS \nMONDAY 8 am to 5 pm \nTUESDAY 8 am to 5 pm \nCLOSED EVERY WEDNESDAY \nTHURSDAY 8 am to 5 pm \nFRIDAY 8 am to 5 pm \nPlease use our online services or mail/drop off payments at: \n8 Newmarket Road \nDurham, NH 03824 \n603-868-5577 \nFax 603-868-1858 \nThe mission of the Town Clerk/Tax Collectors' Office is to serve all Durham residents with efficiency, accuracy, and courtesy. Our Office is responsible for the registration and management of all events and records occurring within the Town of Durham. These include births, marriages, deaths, voter registration, vehicle titling and registration. In addition the office collects and processes all payments and records all official documents of the Town of Durham. \nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tRachel Deane\r\nNH Certified Town Clerk-Tax Collector \r\nEmail Rachel Deane  \r\n\t\t\t\t\tAudrey MacKenzie\r\nDeputy Town Clerk-Tax Collector \r\nEmail Audrey MacKenzie  \r\n\t\t\t\t\tMaura Slavin\r\nAssistant Town Clerk-Tax Collector \r\nEmail Maura Slavin  \r\nTown Clerk/Tax Collector \r\nEmail Town Clerk/Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 8 Newmarket Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Durham ,  NH   03824 \r\n8 Newmarket Road  Durham NH 03824 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  603-868-5577 \r\nFax: 603-868-1858 \r\nHOURS OF OPERATION \nMonday, Tuesday, Thursday, Friday 8:00am-5:00pm \nCLOSED WEDNESDAYS \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Town GIS Map \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t DCAT Media on Demand \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Recreation \r\n\t\t\t Trash & Recycling \r\nContact Us \r\n8 Newmarket Rd \nDurham, NH 03824 \r\nPhone:  603-868-5571 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Calendar \n         Directory \n         Subscribe \n         Welcome Visitors \n         Sustainable Durham \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Sign In \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
